      "value": "If you're able to edit the title, I think that the feature request is for quest should make it into the title. My first thought scrolling past was that you wanted the PC version to attach directly to bluetooth keyboard and avoid the operating system. Reasonable request, might not be feasible.\n\nBut yeah, if you can bluetooth a keyboard to the Quests android, would be nice to see it supported in games. Maybe bother meta if you can't use bluetooth anywhere, seems against the idea of productivity with headsets if not supported",
