      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Possibly related to this: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/keyboard-quest-switch-to-keyboard-overlay which is thankfully marked as tracked. Having to use the VRC keyboard is a big downside of using the Quest and doesn't allow us to use Chatbox to its full potential.",
