  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-26T17:38:15.523Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I use VRChat very often and gotten a bluetooth keyboard so I could chat faster with other players (I find the virtual keyboard to be slow, and my hands can become too jittery sometimes) and then I found out the ingame chat doesnt support it. Could this be added in please? I know PC Vrchat has it so I dont think itd be incredibly difficult to bring that functionality to Quest Vrchat.",
